From 141bca1895536e2c87eccea85200af1781f20af5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Matheus <sirherobrine23@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 28 Jul 2026 16:34:09 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 156/184] net: omci: add profile-aware service provisioning

Introduce a descriptor-backed managed entity registry and profile-dependent
MIB reconciliation. Resolve OMCI bridge, mapper, VLAN, GEM and T-CONT state
into transactional normalized services.

Add common baseline and extended wire codecs, exact duplicate response
caching, active-profile class reporting over Generic Netlink and strict
handling for unsupported datapath managed entities.

Signed-off-by: Matheus Sampaio Queiroga <srherobrine20@gmail.com>
